the tremendous fire of the\n28th army.\nThey tried to cross\non rafts but the rafts were de-\nstroyed and many soldiers\nshot or\ndrowned. Also the 28th laid many\ntraps and played many tricks on\nthe 24th.\nPeace Negotiations Fail\nSoon a stalemate occurred and\nfighting\nstopped for\nawhile.\nNegotiations took place\nwith a\nview to trying to come to a peace.\nBut we hear that these have been\nunsuccessful and fighting is to be\nresumed.\nPoor China and poor Szechwan!\nThey do not seem to be able to\nunite-even in face of serious for-\neign dangers."
